      <div class="pm-title">
        <h1>Design system</h1>
        <p class="pm-title-sentence">Tape and Thread, the Pramaan builder style guide. Every sample uses the real CSS.</p>
        <div class="pm-title-actions ss-tools">
          <button class="pm-btn pm-btn--quiet pm-btn--sm" type="button" id="ss-theme" aria-pressed="false">Dark theme</button>
